# Immortals moving about and talking: goto, at, transfer, violate, poofin and poofout, the four echoes, smote, invis
# and incognito. In the temple (3001): Smokegod (60, the top level), Seraph (56), Cherub (52, the lowest immortal
# level) and Decimus (10). Room 1205 (the Eye of the Hurricane) is private and for implementors only: Smokegod can go
# there while it's empty, Seraph can't. Each echo is marked ("global> " and so on) for those of at least the echoer's
# trust; pecho isn't marked when a top-level immortal sends it. Seraph's own poofin and poofout replace the swirling
# mist, and those below an invisible immortal's level don't see it come and go. Last, Seraph quits through at, which
# at survives. goto also finds a room by an object in it (the fountain).
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect ser
Seraph
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@as cher
goto
goto nowhere
goto 99999
goto 3005
goto decimus
goto fountain
goto decimus
at 3005 look
@as ser
at
at 3005
at nowhere look
at 3005 look
at 1205 look
at decimus say hello from afar
poofin
poofin appears
poofin Seraph glides in on a sunbeam.
poofout Seraph glides out on a sunbeam.
poofin
